      "text": "$(10x+2)(10x+6)(5x+5)=\\left(10x+2\\right)\\left(2\\cdot 5x+3\\right)\\left(5x+5\\right)=\\left(10x+2\\right)\\left(5x+5\\right)\\left(2\\cdot 5x+3\\right)=\\left(10x+2\\right)\\left(5x+5\\right)\\left(10x+3\\right)$  \n\nSince $x$ is odd, let $x=2m+1$ where $m$is some integer. Then our expression is $(10m+12)(m+5)(2m+8)=2(5m+6)(m+5)(2m+4)=2\\cdot2(5m+6)(m+5)(2m+4)$\n\nHence our expression is divisible by $2^2\\cdot3^2\\cdot5=90$.   $\\boxed{90}$",
